  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Thieves Den’s remaining ability uses a theft path immortal material as catalyst: the theft path dao marks in the material are consumed at once, and dao marks from the outside world are stolen. The stolen dao marks attach to those theft path immortal materials. The materials end filled with disorderly dao marks from every path and lose their value.",
