      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_thieves_den"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Steal Dao works the same way: theft path immortal materials are the catalyst, their theft path dao marks are consumed instantly, and stolen outside dao marks must attach to those materials. If the stolen dao marks are disorderly, the materials have no value.",
